# Eino Assistant shell authorization rules.
#
# This product-owned starter file intentionally grants no commands. It is not
# copied from another tool or from any user's approval history.
# Eino creates it once at ~/.eino-assistant/rules/default.rules and never
# overwrites an existing file.
#
# Add only the Codex-compatible prefix rules that you intend to authorize for
# this user. Commands without a matching rule still use Eino's conservative
# read-only fallback or the normal approval flow.
